---
import JasiLabLayout from "../../layouts/JasiLabLayout.astro";
---

<JasiLabLayout
  title="Tambla UG Privacy Policy - JasiLab"
  description="Privacy Policy for Tambla UG, a CVT product by Connected Verification Digital Uganda Limited. How we collect, use, and share rider data."
>
  <section class="section-band max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-deep">Tambla UG</p>
    <h1 class="display-lg mt-2">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-body">
      Last updated: 9 October 2026 · Controller:
      <strong class="text-ink-strong">Connected Verification Digital Uganda Limited</strong> (trading as
      <strong class="text-ink-strong">CVT</strong>)
    </p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-body">
      Privacy contact:
      <a href="mailto:privacy@cvt.ug" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">privacy@cvt.ug</a>
      · Ops:
      <a href="mailto:ops@cvt.ug" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">ops@cvt.ug</a>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-body leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how personal data is collected, used, shared, and protected when you use
        <strong class="text-ink-strong">Tambla UG</strong> (Android / iOS) and related CVT membership services.
        Tambla UG is a <strong class="text-ink-strong">CVT product</strong>. It is not a separate data controller.
      </p>
      <p>
        Primary legal framework: Uganda’s <strong class="text-ink-strong">Data Protection and Privacy Act, 2019</strong>.
        Where EU GDPR / UK GDPR applies, corresponding rights and bases also apply. This notice is not legal advice.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Connected Verification Digital Uganda Limited (certificate of incorporation 80040634389004), trading as CVT,
        operates the Connected Verification Terminal — verification, Trust Profile, and related tools for commercial
        transport and member services in Uganda. Tambla UG is CVT’s rider app for registration, activation, hail /
        Connect, and related member services.
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Public site: <a href="https://www.cvt.co.ug" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">www.cvt.co.ug</a></li>
        <li>Lab site: <a href="https://jasilab.net" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">jasilab.net</a></li>
        <li>Android package: <code class="text-sm">net.jasilab.cvt.tambla</code></li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">2. Agreement when you sign up</h2>
      <p>
        By creating a Tambla account or submitting a Tambla application, you agree that CVT may build and maintain a
        <strong class="text-ink-strong">member profile</strong> about you (including identity, contact,
        vehicle/affiliation, documents you upload, location used for hail matching, and service activity) so we can
        verify you, operate hail, communicate with you, improve trust and safety, and support CVT membership services.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">3. What Tambla processes</h2>
      <div class="overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full border-collapse text-left text-sm">
          <thead>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <th class="py-2 pr-3 font-semibold text-ink-strong">Category</th>
              <th class="py-2 pr-3 font-semibold text-ink-strong">Examples</th>
              <th class="py-2 font-semibold text-ink-strong">Typical use</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody class="align-top">
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Account &amp; contact</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Phone number, OTP</td>
              <td class="py-2">Sign-in, security</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Identity</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Name, NIN, National ID images</td>
              <td class="py-2">Verification</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Photos / documents</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Profile photo, LC letter, ID captures</td>
              <td class="py-2">Activation / review</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Vehicle / affiliation</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Plate, rider details</td>
              <td class="py-2">Membership &amp; hail</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Location</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Approximate + precise; background while Available where permitted</td>
              <td class="py-2">Match nearby hails, standby</td>
            </tr>
            <tr class="border-b border-hairline">
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Device</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Push tokens, basic device/app metadata</td>
              <td class="py-2">Notifications, reliability</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Service records</td>
              <td class="py-2 pr-3">Hail/ride events, CVT inbox messages</td>
              <td class="py-2">Operations &amp; support</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">4. How we use personal data</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Verify identity and operate Tambla registration / activation</li>
        <li>Provide hail / Connect matching and operational communications</li>
        <li>Build and maintain your CVT / Tambla member Trust Profile</li>
        <li>Secure the service (fraud prevention, access control, incident response)</li>
        <li>Meet legal obligations and respond to lawful requests</li>
        <li>Improve CVT products using limited operational analytics</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">5. Partner sharing (with your consent)</h2>
      <p>CVT does <strong class="text-ink-strong">not sell</strong> your personal data.</p>
      <p>
        We may share relevant profile and service information with authorised CVT partners (for example fleet
        operators, finance, device, insurance, or other rider-service partners) only where:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>(a) needed to provide a service you requested in Tambla or another CVT product; and/or</li>
        <li>
          (b) you give <strong class="text-ink-strong">consent</strong> for that partner use (including through
          in-app partner offers or consent flows when those features go live).
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Partners decide their own products (for example loan approval).
        <strong class="text-ink-strong">CVT connects and verifies; partners remain responsible for their own decisions.</strong>
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">6. Other CVT products</h2>
      <p>
        As a Tambla / CVT member, your profile may also be used — with appropriate safeguards and, where required,
        your consent — to offer or process <strong class="text-ink-strong">other CVT products and partner services</strong>
        for you (for example Trust Passport, partner offers, or future member benefits).
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">7. Subprocessors</h2>
      <p>
        We use carefully selected providers under our instructions, which may include hosting, database/auth, email,
        messaging (for example WhatsApp OTP), maps, and push notification infrastructure. Material providers used
        across CVT include services such as Vercel/Cloudflare hosting paths, Supabase, Resend, and Meta/WhatsApp where
        Connect messaging is enabled.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">8. Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep data only as long as needed for verification, accountability, disputes, security, and legal
        obligations. Audit and trust decisions are typically retained for years. Verification documents follow a
        multi-year dispute/audit window after verification, with shorter clocks for abandoned drafts. Deletion or
        correction requests: <a href="mailto:privacy@cvt.ug" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">privacy@cvt.ug</a>.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">9. Your rights and controls</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Access, correction, deletion (where the law allows), restriction/objection</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent where processing is consent-based</li>
        <li>Phone Settings: location, notifications, battery restrictions for hail features</li>
        <li>Complain to Uganda’s Personal Data Protection Office (PDPO) where applicable</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        To request deletion of some or all data while keeping your account, use
        <a href="/tambla/delete-data" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary"
          >jasilab.net/tambla/delete-data</a
        >.
        To delete your Tambla account and associated data, use
        <a href="/tambla/delete-account" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary"
          >jasilab.net/tambla/delete-account</a
        >
        or email <a href="mailto:privacy@cvt.ug" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">privacy@cvt.ug</a>.
        For trust standing disputes, email
        <a href="mailto:ops@cvt.ug" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">ops@cvt.ug</a> with your verification ID.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">10. Children</h2>
      <p>
        Tambla UG is directed at adults operating as commercial transport riders. We do not knowingly enrol children.
        Contact privacy@cvt.ug if you believe a child’s data was submitted in error.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">11. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as Tambla and CVT expand. The “Last updated” date will change, and material updates
        may also be notified in the app or by message where appropriate.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">12. Related CVT policy</h2>
      <p>
        Broader CVT platform practices (registry, Trust Profile, enterprise tools) are described at
        <a href="https://www.cvt.co.ug/en/support/privacy" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary"
          >www.cvt.co.ug/en/support/privacy</a
        >. If there is a conflict about Tambla app processing, this Tambla page and your in-app notices apply for the
        mobile product; CVT remains the controller.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</JasiLabLayout>
